Restore the libyaml-0.so.2 soname

The 0.2.6 release bumped YAML_REVISION and YAML_AGE together, so libtool
computes major = CURRENT - AGE = 1 and the library is built as
libyaml-0.so.1, one below 0.2.5's libyaml-0.so.2. 0.2.6 only adds
interfaces (yaml_get_max_nest_level, yaml_set_max_nest_level), so per the
algorithm in this file it is CURRENT 3, REVISION 0, AGE 1, which keeps
libyaml-0.so.2.

https://github.com/yaml/libyaml/issues/374

--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -18,8 +18,8 @@
 #       else:
 #           YAML_AGE = 0
 m4_define([YAML_RELEASE], 0)
-m4_define([YAML_CURRENT], 2)
-m4_define([YAML_REVISION], 10)
+m4_define([YAML_CURRENT], 3)
+m4_define([YAML_REVISION], 0)
 m4_define([YAML_AGE], 1)
 
 # Initialize autoconf & automake.
